<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - C-TEC STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - C-TEC STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said Wednesday it started coverage of C-TEC Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-18 month target price of $69 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/16 to 36-1/4.</p>
</text>
